      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "OUR TWINKLE NZ (4) drew wider and worked when racing three wide without cover last start so that result can be forgiven. Had won his other three starts since arriving from NZ, two of them at this circuit and distance. Give him another chance. REINETTE (10) has been freshened since she made a nice return at her latest appearance seven-and-a-half weeks ago, coming from a wide barrier and finishing 1.1 metres away in second at this circuit and distance. Should enjoy a nice smother from this draw and if she gets the gaps she has the ability to mix it with them. LUCCA NZ (9) has been solid from this barrier of late, finishing fourth two back and only 3.5m off the winner last week. BET ON THE RIVER (2) draws well and cannot be left out after solid recent performances, the latest a sound third at Northam to follow a string of placings here.",
